WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.299 --> 00:00:05.300
Since the earliest days of humanity, when
we first crawled out of the primordial sludge

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:10.660
and evolved into the bipedal form that we’ve
had for thousands of years, there has always

00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:12.750
been violent conflict.

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:19.160
It’s an inevitability, a sad fact of human
life, that wherever we go, no matter where

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:24.599
in the world we spread to, as long as there
are people, there is the risk of conflict

00:00:24.599 --> 00:00:26.279
breaking out.

00:00:26.279 --> 00:00:30.859
Sometimes it’s small, you get into an argument
with a total stranger, usually over something

00:00:30.859 --> 00:00:34.610
mundane like a parking space or cutting in
line at the supermarket.

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.309
At the time, the things you’re fighting
over seem important, you have a personal stake

00:00:39.309 --> 00:00:40.309
in it.

00:00:40.309 --> 00:00:44.609
Other times you’re just having a bad day
and need to get things out of your system.

00:00:44.609 --> 00:00:49.359
But conflict has a way of escalating, there
is usually always a bigger fight happening

00:00:49.359 --> 00:00:50.500
somewhere out there.

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:55.820
A verbal debate or profanity-laden argument
seems like nothing when compared to trading

00:00:55.820 --> 00:01:01.539
fists, being locked in a physical exchange
of anger and aggression with another person.

00:01:01.539 --> 00:01:05.970
Then there are fights between groups, gangs
from different places meeting in the dark

00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:13.340
to attack each other with weapons, knives,
bats, pipes, chains, anything they can find.

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:17.080
Keep taking that scale of conflict higher
and higher and eventually, you’ll hit the

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:19.550
big one: War.

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:24.880
Conflict on a national, international, or
even a global scale; there is always a war

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:26.610
going on somewhere.

00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:32.970
Like we said, humans have always had an inevitable
capacity for conflict, since the first cavemen

00:01:32.970 --> 00:01:36.060
fought amongst themselves with clubs and rocks.

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:41.240
But what if, for all that time, over those
countless centuries of our existence, there

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:43.990
had been something else there too.

00:01:43.990 --> 00:01:49.680
Something ancient, older than humanity, that
has been preying on our natural capacity for

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:52.360
conflict since prehistoric times.

00:01:52.360 --> 00:01:57.690
A Demon Born of War, known nowadays as SCP-4715.

00:01:57.690 --> 00:02:02.210
Here to answer that big question: “War!

00:02:02.210 --> 00:02:07.180
What is it good for?” once and for all,
though we can’t promise you’ll enjoy the

00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:08.180
answer.

00:02:08.180 --> 00:02:13.500
It’s hard to pin down exactly what kind
of creature SCP-4715 is.

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:18.140
While it does possess teeth consistent with
the dental structure of carnivores, and a

00:02:18.140 --> 00:02:24.480
skull resembling that of a large feline, like
a lion or a tiger, it definitely isn’t a

00:02:24.480 --> 00:02:27.830
lost breed or subspecies of cat.

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:35.540
Genetic analysis of SCP-4715 is, more often
than not, wildly inconsistent, with DNA traces

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:40.140
matching many different forms of wildlife
found in the modern animal kingdom.

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:45.650
However, there are also genetic matches to
mammals alive long before the dawn of mankind,

00:02:45.650 --> 00:02:50.180
dating all the way back to the Miocene and
Pleistocene eras of prehistory, including

00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:56.160
the giant sloth, marsupials, and cave lions,
and a creature called a hyaenodon.

00:02:56.160 --> 00:03:01.040
It even shares trace amounts of DNA with certain
other anomalous animals that the Foundation

00:03:01.040 --> 00:03:02.550
has previously encountered.

00:03:02.550 --> 00:03:08.910
So, this thing is like a big hybrid, a mixture
of all sorts of different species and wildlife,

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:12.810
combining together to form…well, what?

00:03:12.810 --> 00:03:19.320
Robust in frame and standing at a minimum
of just over five meters tall, SCP-4715 is

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:25.870
a highly aggressive beast, sporting huge forelimbs
ending with seven digits and each with a semi-retractable

00:03:25.870 --> 00:03:27.790
claw contained within.

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:33.060
The Demon Born of War also possesses a longer,
secondary pair of limbs, multi-jointed with

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:35.360
three heavy claws at the ends.

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:40.140
Walking on its hind legs, the creature is
steadied by a huge, muscular tail that acts

00:03:40.140 --> 00:03:46.810
as an anchor, helping SCP-4715 maintain balance
much like the third leg of a tripod.

00:03:46.810 --> 00:03:53.470
While SCP-4715 does have a nasty, rather antisocial
tendency to attack any form of human life

00:03:53.470 --> 00:03:58.099
it comes into contact with, we aren’t just
talking about a mindless beast here.

00:03:58.099 --> 00:04:03.580
It seems to solely gun for human beings, showing
little to no interest in hunting any other

00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:08.380
forms of flora and fauna, meanwhile in the
wild, other animals instinctively know to

00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:10.620
keep away from the creature.

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:16.509
SCP-4715 does display some discernible level
of intelligence, roughly akin to that possessed

00:04:16.509 --> 00:04:18.639
by the average chimpanzee.

00:04:18.639 --> 00:04:23.490
It is even smart enough to fashion tools and
weapons out of available materials.

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:28.740
The creature is also highly intuitive, able
to accurately sense the emotional and mental

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:30.910
states of any sapient life nearby.

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:33.599
But this is where it gets even stranger.

00:04:33.599 --> 00:04:37.740
Remember when we mentioned that oh-so-human
capacity for conflict and even war?

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:44.289
Well, in the event SCP-4715 senses any person
with the intention to do harm to another person,

00:04:44.289 --> 00:04:50.240
animal, or to SCP-4715, the creature will
rapidly start to grow.

00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:55.979
Normally, the amount that SCP-4715 increases
its own bodily mass is directly proportional

00:04:55.979 --> 00:05:00.879
to both the number of harm-intending persons
around it and the intensity of their dangerous

00:05:00.879 --> 00:05:01.879
feelings.

00:05:01.879 --> 00:05:07.219
For example, put SCP-4715 next to someone
who just wants to throw hands for the sake

00:05:07.219 --> 00:05:09.460
of it, it wouldn’t get all that bigger.

00:05:09.460 --> 00:05:13.189
But if you were to say, surround it with a
group of warmongering politicians, then it’s

00:05:13.189 --> 00:05:17.300
a safe bet that you’d see some rather different
results.

00:05:17.300 --> 00:05:22.979
The biggest SCP-4715 is known to grow is around
twenty four meters tall, although it has the

00:05:22.979 --> 00:05:27.909
potential to grow much, much bigger if exposed
to enough situations of conflict.

00:05:27.909 --> 00:05:33.789
However, the moment that SCP-4715 loses its
sense of harmful feelings in those nearby,

00:05:33.789 --> 00:05:36.840
then this effect will begin to reverse itself.

00:05:36.840 --> 00:05:42.400
That doesn’t mean SCP-4715 enjoys getting
smaller again, in fact, the creature has been

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:47.599
witnessed attempting to draw individuals into
states of conflict to once again increase

00:05:47.599 --> 00:05:49.259
its mass.

00:05:49.259 --> 00:05:54.120
The Demon Born of War is a very apt and accurate
nickname for the creature, as it seems to

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:59.749
be fascinated by and attracted towards any
state of conflict between human beings.

00:05:59.749 --> 00:06:05.849
In addition to its aggression and size-altering
abilities, SCP-4715 also displays exceptional

00:06:05.849 --> 00:06:10.650
speed and strength, as well as being resistant
to most forms of damage.

00:06:10.650 --> 00:06:14.979
Conventional weaponry does little to cause
lasting physical trauma, its skin is almost

00:06:14.979 --> 00:06:20.659
entirely fireproof, the creature has a natural
resistance to toxins, radiation, or other

00:06:20.659 --> 00:06:26.289
harmful chemicals, and it doesn’t even require
nutrition in order to survive.

00:06:26.289 --> 00:06:31.629
Even on the off chance that something does
happen to cause damage to SCP-4715, the creature

00:06:31.629 --> 00:06:36.879
is more than capable of regenerating and regrowing
its own tissue, even to the extent that a

00:06:36.879 --> 00:06:39.460
lost limb will grow back within a week.

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:45.319
Given humanity’s extensive history of conflicts,
on both a large and small scale, it is no

00:06:45.319 --> 00:06:52.599
surprise that SCP-4715 has been able to sustain
itself since prehistoric times, or so it is

00:06:52.599 --> 00:06:53.599
believed.

00:06:53.599 --> 00:06:58.339
While its true origin predates some of the
earliest human civilizations, the SCP Foundation

00:06:58.339 --> 00:07:03.059
first learned of the creature’s existence
in October of 1916.

00:07:03.059 --> 00:07:07.119
Following this initial discovery, the Foundation
has since uncovered a whole catalog of various

00:07:07.119 --> 00:07:12.909
artifacts and documents from all over the
world that seem to confirm that SCP-4715 has

00:07:12.909 --> 00:07:16.940
existed in its present form throughout the
majority of human history.

00:07:16.940 --> 00:07:23.879
In May of 1980, the Foundation located a Roman
structure found buried deep underneath Istanbul.

00:07:23.879 --> 00:07:27.710
Within were a series of frescoes, an older
form of mural painting.

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:31.800
The first of these depicted the soldiers of
the Roman Empire battling against the forces

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:35.749
of the Sasanian, otherwise known as the Late
Persian Empire.

00:07:35.749 --> 00:07:40.740
The second of these unearthed frescoes showed,
standing in the midst of these two mighty

00:07:40.740 --> 00:07:48.889
armies, was none other than SCP-4715, attacking
both Romans and Persians alike, showing no

00:07:48.889 --> 00:07:51.089
mercy to either side.

00:07:51.089 --> 00:07:55.729
And in the final fresco, Roman soldiers were
shown trying to appease the Demon Born of

00:07:55.729 --> 00:08:01.189
War with offerings of meat, the earliest known
depiction of religious worship focused around

00:08:01.189 --> 00:08:02.710
SCP-4715.

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:08.249
Additionally, the Foundation themselves enact
a similar ritual offering and sacrifice in

00:08:08.249 --> 00:08:15.369
order to keep SCP-4715 contained, known as
‘Procedure 4715-Waning Moon’.

00:08:15.369 --> 00:08:20.249
Every full moon of each month, one member
of D-Class personnel must act as a shaman,

00:08:20.249 --> 00:08:25.429
cover themselves in human blood and offer
the creature sixty kilograms of red meat.

00:08:25.429 --> 00:08:30.499
After feeding, SCP-4715 will sometimes also
eat the shaman too.

00:08:30.499 --> 00:08:35.789
But those Roman frescoes were far from the
only ancient artworks depicting SCP-4715,

00:08:35.789 --> 00:08:40.930
nor are they the earliest form of representation
that the Foundation has discovered.

00:08:40.930 --> 00:08:45.360
A collection of cave paintings was also found
in the Ardèche region of France in October

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:53.360
2005, portraying further instances of SCP-4715
attacking early humans, surrounded by skulls,

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:57.300
and depicted alongside other foreboding, symbolic
imagery.

00:08:57.300 --> 00:09:01.829
A wood carving dating all the way back to
Prussia in the mid-14th Century showed more

00:09:01.829 --> 00:09:03.800
scenes of the same sort.

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:11.060
In this one, sixteen knights mounted on horseback
were engaged in a cavalry charge towards SCP-4715,

00:09:11.060 --> 00:09:15.350
which looked to be significantly bigger than
it had been portrayed in other artifacts,

00:09:15.350 --> 00:09:18.250
thanks to the creature’s size-altering abilities.

00:09:18.250 --> 00:09:24.040
An engraving on this wood carving reads “Banishing
of the beast from the earth”, and curiously

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:30.390
it was sent to the SCP Foundation in 1981
via a courier with the following note included:

00:09:30.390 --> 00:09:36.220
“Dear Sir or Madam, knowledge is power,
and we have observed your organization gathering

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:39.819
resources in order to learn more about the
subject of this carving.

00:09:39.819 --> 00:09:44.710
Given your modus-operandi, we believe that
in providing this historic artifact, free

00:09:44.710 --> 00:09:49.560
of charge, you may be able to successfully
‘contain’ this creature and put a stop

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:51.459
to its disruptive activities.

00:09:51.459 --> 00:09:56.970
Yours Sincerely, Nigel Tissington-Evers, Marshall,
Carter and Dark, LLP.”

00:09:56.970 --> 00:10:01.269
Fourthly, an archaeological dig uncovered
a journal that was promptly confiscated by

00:10:01.269 --> 00:10:02.660
the Foundation.

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:07.550
This journal had belonged to a Chinese farmer,
made homeless by the Taiping rebellion between

00:10:07.550 --> 00:10:10.389
1850 and 1864.

00:10:10.389 --> 00:10:15.910
The man witnessed and sketched in his journal,
a monster emerging from a large pile of corpses

00:10:15.910 --> 00:10:17.940
left discarded on a battlefield.

00:10:17.940 --> 00:10:24.769
The being, or SCP-4715 as we know it, then
started heading towards the city of Nanjing.

00:10:24.769 --> 00:10:29.990
Needless to say, SCP-4715 has gotten itself
around over the centuries.

00:10:29.990 --> 00:10:34.840
Drawn out to anywhere that conflict is occurring,
the Demon Born of War doesn’t seem to have

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:37.840
much compunction over being witnessed by humans.

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:44.820
But a highly important question still remains,
where on Earth did SCP-4715 actually come

00:10:44.820 --> 00:10:45.820
from?

00:10:45.820 --> 00:10:50.050
This beast has stood in the midst of human
civilization since we first learned to walk,

00:10:50.050 --> 00:10:53.800
feeding on perhaps every conflict our species
has ever had.

00:10:53.800 --> 00:10:55.920
But surely, it must have started somewhere?

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:58.120
A nest, a hive maybe?

00:10:58.120 --> 00:11:03.430
Or perhaps a dark, unassuming corner of the
world that few people have ever set foot in.

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:07.589
The Foundation has learned of a Location of
Interest designated under the name ‘LoI

00:11:07.589 --> 00:11:08.920
517 Sigma’.

00:11:08.920 --> 00:11:15.579
In 2009, a group of outdoor enthusiasts stumbled
upon a place unlike any they had ever seen,

00:11:15.579 --> 00:11:20.170
describing it as “some kind of shiny bunker
or Egyptian Colosseum in some caves lit up

00:11:20.170 --> 00:11:21.779
by shiny plants.”

00:11:21.779 --> 00:11:26.720
The SCP Foundation stepped in to investigate
these findings, discovering a cave system

00:11:26.720 --> 00:11:29.279
and a structure contained within a network
of tunnels.

00:11:29.279 --> 00:11:35.660
Strangely, parts of these caverns seemed to
be organic, similar to SCP-2932; Also known

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:39.790
as Titania’s Prison,
this anomaly is an ancient temple formed of

00:11:39.790 --> 00:11:45.410
plants, designed for use as a prison that
can contain its inmates in pods.

00:11:45.410 --> 00:11:51.410
This cave system, LoI 517 Sigma, appears to
be of a similar design and function, however,

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:56.720
it is instead focused solely on the containment
of SCP-4715.

00:11:56.720 --> 00:12:01.730
Much of the organic devices found within LoI
517 Sigma are still alive and show little

00:12:01.730 --> 00:12:06.970
signs of damage, however, they remain inactive,
powered down while the Demon Born of War is

00:12:06.970 --> 00:12:09.579
held elsewhere by the Foundation.

00:12:09.579 --> 00:12:14.149
Deep in the very heart of the complex network
of caves and tunnels lies a structure formed

00:12:14.149 --> 00:12:20.310
of an indestructible plant; a cell that once
housed SCP-4715 itself.

00:12:20.310 --> 00:12:24.760
So, who trapped SCP-4715 in this place?

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:28.490
And how did it ever escape without leaving
behind any traces of damage?

00:12:28.490 --> 00:12:34.529
Well, throughout the complex of LoI 517 Sigma
are places that seem to have once been inhabited,

00:12:34.529 --> 00:12:38.730
residential areas for whoever the creature’s
mysterious jailors were.

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:45.041
And there are even more images of SCP-4715,
once again showing it locked in battle, but

00:12:45.041 --> 00:12:47.070
not with humans this time.

00:12:47.070 --> 00:12:52.320
In these drawings, the monster is fighting
unknown entities and seems to be much, much

00:12:52.320 --> 00:12:55.459
larger than the Foundation first thought possible.

00:12:55.459 --> 00:13:01.500
There are remnants within LoI 517 Sigma, of
carvings and warnings, that describe “A

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:06.709
demon born of blood and war”, a bloody night
where children and Fae were seemingly slaughtered

00:13:06.709 --> 00:13:10.750
indiscriminately by an abomination born out
of atrocity.

00:13:10.750 --> 00:13:17.350
SCP-4715 killed thousands of those that imprisoned
it, and perhaps even created it in the first

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:18.350
place.

00:13:18.350 --> 00:13:20.490
But someone set it free.

00:13:20.490 --> 00:13:25.500
Within the cave complex, a skeleton lies next
to an organic mechanism believed to have controlled

00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:27.689
the power for the monster’s prison.

00:13:27.689 --> 00:13:34.300
The skeleton belonged to an instance of SCP-1000,
a species of ape more commonly known as Bigfoot.

00:13:34.300 --> 00:13:40.420
In its final message, this ape described mankind
above turning their weapons against each other.

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:46.589
“They know not of the demon born from war,
and cast aside any tool that could turn aside

00:13:46.589 --> 00:13:47.829
its fury…

00:13:47.829 --> 00:13:52.920
May the hairless usurpers suffer at its hands,
and pay for their transgression.

00:13:52.920 --> 00:13:58.129
To any Child of the Night who finds my message,
know that I have committed this crime to avenge

00:13:58.129 --> 00:13:59.329
our demise.

00:13:59.329 --> 00:14:01.510
You will not forgive me.”

00:14:01.510 --> 00:14:07.730
And with that, seeking vengeance for a dead
race, SCP-4715 was unleashed to prey on the

00:14:07.730 --> 00:14:10.209
conflicts of humankind.

00:14:10.209 --> 00:14:16.569
Now go check out “SCP-1984 - Dead Hand”
and “SCP-186 - To End All Wars” for more

00:14:16.569 --> 00:14:18.080
frightening wartime SCPs!

